{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_title", "source_sha256": "a1c0ca8dcb8b9677c775a3d4422a57075632c4e1eb5dfab509eafa0125caffd6", "ja": "君は宝石", "zh": "你是宝石", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd68a731a2b8b7796dd48930d01c3ae1d789d675bb72550abb0860e0d1ed644d", "ja": "プロデューサーに大人っぽさを認めさせよう\nと、内緒で写真のモデルを引き受ける真美。\nカメラマンの女性と接しているうち嘘が積み\n重なり罪悪感が芽生えるが、プロデューサー\nにバレてしまい、すべてを打ち明ける。", "zh": "为了让制作人认可自己的成熟魅力，\n真美悄悄接下了摄影模特的工作。\n在和女性摄影师接触的过程中谎言越积越多，\n真美渐渐萌生了罪恶感。事情败露给制作人后，\n她终于向制作人坦白了一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c2676324871a45620a3761f5f423d0480f4d36581dfae7a257dbb06881a0abc1", "ja": "（真美のステージが終わった。假野さんには、\nエントランスで待っていてもらっている）", "zh": "（真美的舞台结束了。已经请假野小姐在入口等着了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1001_kano", "source_sha256": "22d4519d2d53ba8c56c22aeba6d80f7e1c2748f07891b88de5c78998d06be921", "ja": "真美さ～ん！！", "zh": "真美——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "8c707ea29c22692cace14f86d308687dd3b91655cccbf90d2f558839838538a1", "ja": "假野さん！", "zh": "假野小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1003_kano", "source_sha256": "de250495720ca6322e1687136ab4cbb8cc511ab9fc6d62f6816c20c640abe77c", "ja": "アイドルのライブ初めて観たけど、すごいね……！\nすごく良かった！　感動した！", "zh": "第一次看偶像的现场演出，好厉害啊……！\n真的很棒！太感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "a82a192774cda98891e4f3dd6206533598bd5d0998670516f142142a60011c54", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　でしょ？　まぁスゴいのは、\nアイドルっていうか真美なんだけど！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪ 是吧？不过厉害的，\n与其说是偶像，不如说是真美啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1005_kano", "source_sha256": "720d011ef0249b87e3f3af61c439c389cae8c6f51a417e2f1e025d51c092fb20", "ja": "あはは！　真美さんだけでなく、\nみんなもすごかったです。", "zh": "啊哈哈！不只是真美小姐，\n大家也都很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1006_kano", "source_sha256": "fa3563c0c6ceef1150c1e37b878ebe9bc178b5140f76a6e425d9dafd5ba0b8d4", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n写真集、やっぱり出したいです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n我果然还是想出写真集。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1007_kano", "source_sha256": "e3deba0ace03488b2e98d5238b4b9e301a72a9ee5528e3ebe615023e404f0f3e", "ja": "思いっきりアイドルしてる真美さんの事も、\n撮りたいです！　いいですか？", "zh": "全力展现偶像一面的真美，\n我也想拍！可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "628431b3d884ed0230adfe21a9c5630e0f6d719c62235d20ca66ea6b7029c47c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n願ってもない事です。是非、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "谢谢您！\n这正是求之不得的事。请务必拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "24e0c23b5c9b13bb65421efe730a584fe1adeec377543bbd7753e44cf3c6de3c", "ja": "プロデューサーの兄ちゃんと\nカメラマンの姉ちゃんが、真美を挟んで固い握手……。", "zh": "制作人哥哥和摄影师姐姐，以真美为中心，紧紧地握住了手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "3cf5c7a24172c63dc631099d7f8915b20063b2e1043264cd29b14a9b1dc71588", "ja": "これぞ、雨降ってThe 花丸ってやつだね♪", "zh": "这才叫雨过天晴，花丸♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1011_p", "source_sha256": "64c63f5580c435bec5072362ad06d1139d1dc26955afa7556ea959fd7d7fa411", "ja": "「地固まる」な。だいたい、真美が最初から\nきちんと説明してれば、雨も降らなかったんだぞ。", "zh": "是“雨过天晴”，不是什么“花开圆满”。归根结底，要是真美从一开始就好好解释清楚，根本就不会掀起这场风波。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "8219804d2f533216b008ca0a2c748ada16c8e7f4c66cacb2fcfac482cc6d5b37", "ja": "もう、兄ちゃんはヤボだなぁ！\nこういうのは、結果オーライでいいんだってば！", "zh": "真是的，哥哥太不解风情了！\n这种事只要结果好就行了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1013_kano", "source_sha256": "de0ea4d013eaa2fdbef6188e8cbede10fd6417aca7b760bb1ee2e6f829e81990", "ja": "ふふ、そうかも？\n真美さん、写真集頑張りましょうね！", "zh": "呵呵，也许吧？  \n真美，我们一起努力完成写真集吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_164_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "4cf393609547fcbae263e255467fa6849bb067d884f02365655a4ce4c0e5bdd5", "ja": "うん！\nありがとう、姉ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯！\n谢谢姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
